-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">厳選名宿</span>\n            <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">4. ホテル大山 しろがね（大山寺参道沿い）</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.6</span>\n        </div>\n      \n\n          <div class=\"mb-4\">\n            <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/19880/19880.jpg\" alt=\"ホテル大山　しろがね 施設外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          </div>\n        \n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>〜大山登山・スキーに最適な立地！地元食材の創作会席とアットホームな宿〜</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">① どんな旅行に向いている宿か</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">登山客、ファミリー、スキー旅行。</p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-300 font-black\">⑦ 「だから、この旅行ならここ」</h4>\n<p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\"><strong>「大山寺参道すぐの立地で温かいおもてなしと大山グルメを楽しむならここ！」</strong></p>\n<h4 class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border mt-3.5 mb-1.5 inline-block text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/80 border-amber-200 font-bold\">⑧ 楽天トラベルで空室・料金を確認</h4>\n\n        <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n          <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F19880%2F19880.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-60